        return out("when you go out to war (20:1) — against your enemies, not your brothers; horse and chariot as one; more in your eyes; fear them not — 7:18's rule paid to the war chapter (the Sifrei 190:16-21; Mishnah Sotah 8:1; seven_nations' %s by CALL): THE WRITE war_fear_barred, a BLOCK on Israel at the chapters' own day; the soldier of Judah at war with Simeon barred from it" % (SN_PHAR[1][0],), ['war_fear_barred'])
