        dat("THE WRITE priest_war_speech_commanded — a STATUS on israel_people at the chapters' own day (DJ2); THE PARAMETER the_priest_anointed_for_war (Sotah 8:1 — not the high priest; the holy tongue; Phinehas the tape's instance); the exam's person the high priest who speaks the war speech in place of the anointed — barred from it (not his office)")
