        move('the Sifrei 193:6, 194:1-2, 195:1-7, 196:1-3, 197:1-4 (read whole at the reading); MISHNAH SOTAH 8:2 and 8:3 (the exam rows, read whole)', "SOTAH 8:2 — WHO RETURN: 'a new house' — the straw house, the cattle shed, the wood shed, the storehouse; the builder, the buyer, the heir, the gifted alike; 'a vineyard' — five fruit trees even of five kinds; the planter, the layerer, the grafter, the buyer, the heir, the gifted; 'betrothed a wife' — a virgin, a widow, even the levirate widow, even one who heard his brother died in the war; ALL THESE HEAR THE PRIEST'S WORDS AND RETURN, and supply water and food and repair the roads. SOTAH 8:3 — WHO DO NOT RETURN: the gatehouse, the veranda, the balcony; four fruit trees or five barren; the remarried divorcee; the widow to a high priest, the divorcee or the released levirate widow to a common priest, a mamzeret (a woman born of a forbidden union) or a Gibeonite to an Israelite, an Israelite's daughter to the same — these do not return; R. Judah the house rebuilt on its site does not return, R. Eliezer the brick house in the Sharon does not return; 'AND NOT REDEEMED IT' — the vineyard's fourth year, Leviticus 19:24's redemption (196:1 — holiness by name in the ledger's row, the seat's cell not called: a DATA row)")
        dat("THE WRITE officers_exemptions_commanded — a STATUS on israel_people at the chapters' own day (DJ2); THE PARAMETERS the_houses_kinds, the_vineyards_kinds, the_betrotheds_kinds (Sotah 8:2) and the_non_returners (Sotah 8:3); the exam's person the man who built a gatehouse — does not return (Sotah 8:3): barred from the return; the builder of a straw house returns")
        return out("the four exemptions (20:5-7) — the house, the vineyard, the betrothed: who return (Sotah 8:2 — the straw house, the five trees, the widow) and who do not (Sotah 8:3 — the gatehouse, four trees, the remarried divorcee; R. Judah's and R. Eliezer's houses); the fourth year's redemption (the Sifrei 193:6-197:4): THE WRITE officers_exemptions_commanded, a STATUS on Israel at the chapters' own day; the builder of a gatehouse barred from the return", ['officers_exemptions_commanded'])
